<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">R4-CGQA: Retrieval-based Vision Language Models for Computer Graphics Image Quality Assessment</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Zhuangzi Li
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Jian Jin
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Shilv Cai
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Weisi Lin
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><span id="id1" class="ltx_text">College of Computing and Data Science, Nanyang Technological University, Singapore</span>
